npei State in the Federated States of Micronesia. When built, the wall was about 0.5 miles (0.80 km) in length and 8 feet (2.4 m) in height with a parapet that ranged in height from 2–3 feet (0.61–0.91 m).","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Spanish Wall"},{"id":"micronesia_dolohmwar","areaId":"micronesia","name":"Dolohmwar","category":"viewpoint","tags":["mountains","views","hiking"],"location":{"lat":6.85528,"lng":158.23667},"visitMinutes":180,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"micronesia_dolohmwar","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":52,"wikidataSitelinks":11,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["dolohmwarfederatedstatesofmicronesia","federatedstatesofmicronesia"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Dolohmwar or Totolom is the third highest point of the Federated States of Micronesia, with an altitude of 760 metres (2,595 ft). Mount Nanlaud 1.9 km to the north-northwest is the highest point at 2,566 feet (782 m). Between the two is Ngihneni, within a meter or two of Nanlaud.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Dolohmwar"},{"id":"micronesia_osm_stone_look_out","areaId":"micronesia","name":"Stone Look-Out","category":"viewpoint","tags":["views","photo","sunset"],"location":{"lat":6.96398,"lng":158.19053},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"micronesia_osm_stone_look_out","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":13,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["stonelookout","federatedstatesofmicronesia"],"bestLight":"sunset"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}